 :scope-exclusions
 ["direct forming-line equipment control (jiggering/jolleying machine, RAM
   press -- plant supervisor's exclusive authority)"
  "direct kiln-line equipment control/actuation (tunnel kiln, bisque/glost
   firing -- plant supervisor's exclusive authority)"
  "plant-safety or glaze-material-safety decisions (lead-free glaze
   compliance judgment remains human)"
  "real freight dispatch (this actor only drafts a shipment-coordination
   record, never dispatches a carrier)"]

 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-2393 with Advisor/Governor/Phase/Registry/Store/
  Operation/Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-2391 module-for-module, adapted
  from refractory-products to porcelain/ceramic-products manufacturing --
  porcelainmfg.* namespace, Porcelain/Ceramic Plant Operations Governor):
  - Governor: eleven concrete HARD checks elaborating four HARD invariants
    (propose-only effect, closed op allowlist, closed proposal-effect
    allowlist / no direct forming-kiln-line control, permanent
    forming-kiln-line-actuate block) plus a confidence/high-stakes escalation
    gate (SOFT, human may approve)
  - Registry: pure functions -- equipment/batch verified+registered gates,
    shipment-weight-exceeded recompute, product-type-valid? (8-member closed
    set: porcelain/bone-china/stoneware/earthenware tableware,
    decorative-ceramic, art-pottery, technical-ceramic, ceramic-insulator),
    glaze-defect-rate-valid? (0-100%), chip-resistance-valid? (0-500N) --
    replacing 2391's thermal-shock-cycles/cold-crushing-strength-mpa pair
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (SSoT + append-only audit ledger,
    sample batches/equipment seeded for offline tests/demo)
  - Advisor: PorcelainAdvisor -- deterministic mock (default) + llm-advisor
    (langchain.model-backed, same proposal-EDN contract)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate, :schedule-maintenance permanently absent from
    every phase's :auto set (structural, not a milestone)
  - Operation: PorcelainOperationActor -- full langgraph-clj StateGraph
    (advise -> govern -> decide -> commit|hold|request-approval), real
    interrupt-before/resume approval workflow
  - Sim: demo runner (-main) exercising all four happy paths + nine HARD-hold
    scenarios directly
  - Ops (closed allowlist, all :effect :propose): log-production-batch
    (product-type/weight/glaze-defect-rate/chip-resistance data logging),
    schedule-maintenance (forming/kiln-line-equipment maintenance scheduling),
    flag-safety-concern (kiln-safety/glaze-material-safety -- ALWAYS
    escalates), coordinate-shipment (outbound shipment coordination)
  - Tests: 76 tests / 209 assertions across
    governor-contract/operation/phase/registry/store-contract, all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - GitHub repo created directly as cloud-itonami-isic-2393 (no rename
    needed)"

